# Firebase service-account keys (FCM V1). Never committed; the real one lives
# outside the repo. google-services.json is different: it is public-facing and
# is committed on purpose (Expo requires it in the project for builds).
*firebase-adminsdk*.json
*fcm-service-account*.json

# typescript
*.tsbuildinfo

example

